<title>FRANCE: Sabanci takes 40 pct in Carrefour Turkey.</title>
<headline>Sabanci takes 40 pct in Carrefour Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>French retailer Carrefour said on Thursday that Sabanci of Turkey would take a 40 percent stake in the Turkish subsidiary of Carrefour for an undisclosed consideration.</p>
<p>Carrefour said in a statement that it would retain the remainder.</p>
<p>Carrefour has a 14,000 square metre supermarket in the Kadikoy area of Istanbul.</p>
<p>Sabanci, which Carrefour described as one of Turkey's most important industrial groups, is family-owned.</p>
<p>Carrefour said the move was aimed at accelerating the development of its Turkey activities.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
